SAGA sg-delta-keep TX d-keep
STEP park APPLIED undo-park
STEP seal APPLIED undo-seal
SAGA sg-delta-split TX d-split
STEP stage APPLIED undo-stage
STEP mark COMPENSATED undo-mark
STEP push APPLIED undo-push
SAGA sg-delta-dup TX d-dup
STEP hold APPLIED undo-hold
STEP note SKIPPED undo-note
STEP release APPLIED undo-release
SAGA sg-delta-ghost TX d-ghost
STEP draft APPLIED undo-draft
STEP queue PENDING undo-queue
SAGA sg-delta-full TX d-full
STEP lock APPLIED undo-lock
